"kind":"def","line":119,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QAnalysis.lean#L119-L119","doc":"Counit on `H`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QLogarithm.coprod","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QLogarithm.coprod","kind":"def","line":117,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QAnalysis.lean#L117-L117","doc":"Coproduct on `H`, encoded as `coprod : H → H × H`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QLogarithm.log_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QLogarithm.log_q","kind":"def","line":115,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QAnalysis.lean#L115-L115","doc":"The primitive element `log_q ∈ H`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QLogarithm.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QLogarithm.mk","kind":"ctor","line":113,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QAnalysis.lean#L113-L113","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QLogarithm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QLogarithm","kind":"structure","line":106,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QAnalysis.lean#L106-L127","doc":"**q-Logarithm data**: an abstract primitive element of the q-shuffle\nHopf algebra, characterised by primitivity\n`Δ_q(log_q) = log_q ⊗ 1 + 1 ⊗ log_q` and vanishing counit\n`ε(log_q) = 0`.\n\nRelocated here 2026-09-06 alongside `QExponential`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:q-logarithm","label":"def:q-logarithm","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-logarithm.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QExponential.flow_invariant","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QExponential.flow_invariant","kind":"theorem","line":104,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QAnalysis.lean#L104-L104","doc":"Flow equation: `D_q e_q = e_q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QExponential.counit_eq_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QExponential.counit_eq_one","kind":"theorem","line":102,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QAnalysis.lean#L102-L102","doc":"Counit: `ε(e_q) = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QExponential.grouplike","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QExponential.grouplike","kind":"theorem","line":100,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QAnalysis.lean#L100-L100","doc":"Grouplike axiom: `Δ_q(e_q) = (e_q, e_q)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QExponential.D_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QExponential.D_q","kind":"def","line":98,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QAnalysis.lean#L98-L98","doc":"q-Jackson derivative on `H`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QExponential.counit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QExponential.counit","kind":"def","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QAnalysis.lean#L96-L96","doc":"Counit on `H`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QExponential.coprod","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QExponential.coprod","kind":"def","line":94,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QAnalysis.lean#L94-L94","doc":"Coproduct on `H`, encoded as `coprod : H → H × H`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QExponential.e_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QExponential.e_q","kind":"def","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QAnalysis.lean#L92-L92","doc":"The grouplike element `e_q ∈ H`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QExponential.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QExponential.mk","kind":"ctor","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QAnalysis.lean#L90-L90","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QExponential","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QExponential","kind":"structure","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QAnalysis.lean#L80-L104","doc":"**q-Exponential data**: an abstract grouplike of the q-shuffle Hopf\nalgebra, characterised by the flow equation `D_q g = g`.\n\nRelocated here 2026-09-06, completing the relocation this module was\ncreated for: the 2026-06-09 audit moved `QDilogarithm` so that the\ncompanion `*-unique.lean` display files could import a real structure,\nbut left `QExponential` and `QLogarithm` inlined in four siblings\napiece.  Their uniqueness axioms were refuted from those inline\ncopies; see `QAnalysisUniquenessCounterexamples`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:q-exponential","label":"def:q-exponential","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-exponential.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QDilogarithm.pentagon","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QDilogarithm.pentagon","kind":"theorem","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QAnalysis.lean#L73-L73","doc":"**Pentagon identity** (5-term relation). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QDilogarithm.div","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QDilogarithm.div","kind":"def","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QAnalysis.lean#L71-L71","doc":"Division `(x,y) ↦ x/y`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QDilogarithm.compl","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QDilogarithm.compl","kind":"def","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QAnalysis.lean#L69-L69","doc":"Complement `x ↦ 1 - x`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QDilogarithm.mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QDilogarithm.mul","kind":"def","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QAnalysis.lean#L67-L67","doc":"Binary composition for pentagon arguments. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QDilogarithm.Li2_eval","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QDilogarithm.Li2_eval","kind":"def","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QAnalysis.lean#L65-L65","doc":"Evaluation map. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QDilogarithm.log_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QDilogarithm.log_q","kind":"def","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QAnalysis.lean#L63-L63","doc":"The level-1 primitive `log_q ∈ H`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QDilogarithm.Li2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QDilogarithm.Li2","kind":"def","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QAnalysis.lean#L61-L61","doc":"The level-2 primitive `Li₂_q ∈ H × H`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QDilogarithm.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QDilogarithm.mk","kind":"ctor","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QAnalysis.lean#L59-L59","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QDilogarithm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QDilogarithm","kind":"structure","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QAnalysis.lean#L55-L77","doc":"**q-Dilogarithm data**: a level-2 iterated primitive of `H_q`\ncharacterised by the pentagon identity.  The pentagon relation is\nadditive, so the carrier `H` is required to support `+`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:q-dilogarithm","label":"def:q-dilogarithm","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-dilogarithm.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QHeatEquation.evolves","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QHeatEquation.evolves","kind":"theorem","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QAnalysis.lean#L53-L53","doc":"The evolution equation `∂ₜ u(t,x) = -Δ_q u(t,x)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QHeatEquation.dq_u","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QHeatEquation.dq_u","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QAnalysis.lean#L51-L51","doc":"q-Laplacian applied to `u`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QHeatEquation.dt_u","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QHeatEquation.dt_u","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QAnalysis.lean#L49-L49","doc":"Time-derivative `∂ₜ u`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QHeatEquation.u","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QHeatEquation.u","kind":"def","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QAnalysis.lean#L47-L47","doc":"Time-dependent section `u : ℝ → S → Archimedean.R_q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QHeatEquation.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QHeatEquation.mk","kind":"ctor","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QAnalysis.lean#L45-L45","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QHeatEquation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QHeatEquation","kind":"structure","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QAnalysis.lean#L42-L53","doc":"**q-Heat equation data**: a one-parameter family with q-Laplacian,\nsatisfying `∂ₜ u = -Δ_q u` pointwise (algebraic shadow of the PDE). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:q-heat-equation","label":"def:q-heat-equation","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-heat-equation.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QResolvent.inverse_witness","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QResolvent.inverse_witness","kind":"theorem","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QAnalysis.lean#L40-L40","doc":"Inverse witness: `R ∘ delta_q = id`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QResolvent.R","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QResolvent.R","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QAnalysis.lean#L38-L38","doc":"The resolvent `R_q(s)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QResolvent.s","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QResolvent.s","kind":"def","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QAnalysis.lean#L36-L36","doc":"The spectral parameter. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QResolvent.delta_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QResolvent.delta_q","kind":"def","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QAnalysis.lean#L34-L34","doc":"The q-Laplacian endomorphism. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QResolvent.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QResolvent.mk","kind":"ctor","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QAnalysis.lean#L32-L32","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QResolvent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QResolvent","kind":"structure","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QAnalysis.lean#L28-L40","doc":"**q-Resolvent data.** Packages the q-Laplacian `delta_q`, the\nspectral parameter `s`, and an inverse witness for `s + delta_q`\nin the convolution algebra `𝓗_q`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:q-resolvent","label":"def:q-resolvent","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-resolvent.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}